+// servingOf is every model a provider lists for an API other than chat:
+// its fetched list (catalog.LiveServing) plus the ones a plan says it
+// serves (PlanRetrieval), as providers.go's Retrieval count reads them, and
+// — a plugin's — the ones its own word files under another API (#42): a
+// plugin's models are in no fetched list, so nothing else told Settings
